<section class="section">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="legal-body">
      <p>Flatirons Creative Studio ("we", "us") is a digital marketing agency based in Boulder, Colorado. This page explains what information we collect through flatironscreativestudio.com, why we collect it, and the choices you have.</p>

      <h2>Information you give us</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact and project intake forms.</strong> If you fill in a form, we receive what you enter, such as your name, email, phone number, company and details about your project. We use it to reply to you and to scope and quote work. Form submissions are processed by Formspree.</li>
        <li><strong>Booking a call.</strong> When you book through cal.com, the details you enter there (such as your name, email and any notes) are collected by cal.com and shared with us so we can meet with you.</li>
        <li><strong>Client file uploads.</strong> Existing clients may receive a private link to upload files. Uploaded files are stored with our storage provider, Cloudflare, and are used only for the client's project.</li>
        <li><strong>Email.</strong> If you email us, we keep the correspondence so we can respond and keep a record of the work.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Google Analytics (Google tag) to understand how the site is used, for example which pages are visited and what kind of device is used. Google Analytics uses cookies or similar identifiers. You can opt out with Google's browser add-on for Analytics opt-out, or by blocking cookies in your browser.</li>
        <li><strong>Hosting logs.</strong> Our host, Netlify, may log technical information such as IP address, browser type and the pages requested, for security and reliability.</li>
        <li><strong>Fonts.</strong> The site loads fonts from Google Fonts, which means your browser makes a request to Google's servers when a page loads.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use the information above to respond to enquiries, deliver and invoice client work, run and improve the website, and keep the site secure. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We share information only with the service providers that help us run the studio and the site: Formspree (forms), cal.com (bookings), Google (analytics and fonts), Netlify (hosting) and Cloudflare (file storage). These providers handle information under their own privacy terms. We may also disclose information if the law requires it.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep information for as long as we need it for the purposes above, including keeping records of client work. You can ask us to delete your information at any time, and we will do so unless we are required to keep it.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to tell you what information we hold about you, to correct it, or to delete it. Email <a href="mailto:tcusworth@fcstudio.us">tcusworth@fcstudio.us</a> and we will respond.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is for businesses and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

      <h2>Other sites</h2>
      <p>The site links to other websites, including our client portal, LinkedIn and aiclarityindex.com. Those sites have their own privacy practices.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Flatirons Creative Studio, Boulder, Colorado. <a href="mailto:tcusworth@fcstudio.us">tcusworth@fcstudio.us</a></p>
    </div>
